  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Tucked behind an exclusive gated entry, this architectural coastal home is a rare expression of sophisticated North Shore living.\r\nOne of only two, 218a Lake Rd delivers the scale and measure of a substantial home with the effortless appeal of luxury apartment living.\r\nDesigned by Cornthwaite Architects, the north-facing property captures awe-inspiring sea views framed by Auckland’s iconic coastline. Natural light filters throughout the day, enhancing the connection to its spectacular surroundings.\r\nThe interior is impressive, vaulted ceilings, warm timber panelling, bespoke cabinetry and a feature fireplace create a striking living environment.\r\nCarefully considered, the exterior showcases contrasting cedar and black joinery adding a distinctive architectural edge.\r\nA sophisticated kitchen with scullery and generous living spaces open to an expansive deck, creating a seamless outdoor connection while showcasing its world-class ocean panorama.\r\nSpanning two levels connected by an internal lift, the versatile floor plan includes four generous bedrooms (starring a private master suite), a study, underfloor heating, climate control, and triple-car garaging.\r\nMoments from Takapuna’s golden sands and within easy reach of leading schools, this is a property defined by its architecture, privacy, scale and extraordinary coastal setting. \r\nEnjoy the effortless appeal of apartment-style living with the freedom and security of freehold ownership without the obligations or restrictions of a body corporate.",
